      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGPIE SPICE (1) is a handy dog who jumped from box 7 last time out and scored by 4 lengths at this track (23.33). Has a strong record from box 1, including two wins. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. COME ON LUBA (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.75 lengths at this track in a handy 17.79 beating Cadillac Express. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Likely to be in the finish. APPELLANT (8) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Finished third (23.78) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Must be included in calculations. CINTA'S GOLD (4) cannot be left out despite racing over this journey for the first time.",
